# Firebase client app configs and Admin SDK service-account keys — kept out
# of git as a precaution. The release-apk workflow reconstructs
# google-services.json from a repo secret at build time (see
# .github/workflows/release-apk.yml); regenerate locally with
# `flutterfire configure` if you need it for local Android builds.
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
firebase-debug.log

